OL,3,GNEWSACountry legend Garth Brooks
OL,4,Areturns to Belfast with 2027 gigs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmerican country music legend Garth
OL,7,FBrooks will return to perform in
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland for the first time
OL,9,Fsince 1998 with two gigs in Belfast in
OL,10,FMay of next year.
OL,12,FBrooks will play two outdoor concerts
OL,13,Fat Boucher Road Playing Fields on 21
OL,14,Fand 22 May 2027.
OL,16,FHis last gigs in Northern Ireland were
OL,17,Fa five-night run at the King's Hall in
OL,18,FBelfast in November 1998, after which
OL,19,Fhe said the reaction from fans left his
OL,20,Fears "ringing for three days".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
