OL,3,GNEWSACountry legend Garth Brooks
OL,4,Areturns to Belfast with 2027 gigs
OL,5,
OL,6,FNext year's concerts in Belfast will be
OL,7,Fthe first of 10 on the island of
OL,8,FIreland, with two shows each in Galway,
OL,9,FKilkenny, Limerick and Cork.
